Subject: [PATCH] mt76: guard uninitialized Airoha NPU queues
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [local fault isolation candidate]

Keep the official NPU attachment path enabled by default. Retain cleanup
and allocation guards for failed initialization or load-time opt-out.

